1. Content-Based Recommendation (Matching Users with Institutions & Courses)
Recommend institutions and courses based on user preferences (e.g., province, affiliation, past interactions).
Implementation Steps:
Track user interactions (e.g., views, ratings, searches).
Use TF-IDF or cosine similarity to match users with similar institutions/courses.
Show "Recommended Institutions" or "Courses You May Like."

2. Location-Based Recommendations
Suggest institutions close to the user’s location.
Filter institutions based on province or a given radius (e.g., Haversine formula for geo-distance).